OL,3,GNEWSATwo riders injured in off-road
OL,4,Abike crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe riders of two off-road motorbikes
OL,7,Fhave been seriously injured after
OL,8,Fcolliding with cars in separate
OL,9,Fincidents on the same day.
OL,11,FIn Leeds, West Yorkshire Police said a
OL,12,Fgreen Moto Madness pit bike had been
OL,13,Ftravelling up Newlay Lane in Bramley
OL,14,Ftowards the Ganners Mount junction with
OL,15,Fno lights on when it struck a black
OL,16,FVauxhall Insignia at about 22:10 BST on
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,19,FA man, 20, was arrested for possession
OL,20,Fof Class A drugs and driving under the
OL,21,Finfluence and has since been bailed
OL,22,Fpending further inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
